<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent attacks continue in the southern insurgency zone, with pipe bombs wounding army officers and security volunteers in Narathiwat and Yala and grenade attacks in Trang, while Thai security forces killed suspected drug couriers and seized half a tonne of ice in Phetchaburi. The Thai Army proposed sending cadets to China for training and announced six trust measures to test Cambodia’s sincerity, and ASEAN and the UN are hosting talks on border heritage sites and peace forums. Meanwhile, the central banks of Singapore, Malaysia and Thailand have joined the BLOOM cross-border digital money settlement initiative, expanding stablecoin payments across the three countries. 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE5XbS1OSEpXR1dhUHhIUmx2VjlXbVREeHRCMy0walNHdGtGWTh3Mkd3YlBBUlY0RE9XekNGZEE0c3lSdnlMcHBDclUyQWhVNG1yRF9hZk01T1dVX1BsT0JuWXk2ZXhkUGpWU1J2WndQYlZCbVc1dnpBUGVkNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Crypto Economy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOS0kxM2Z6eU5zdDViRkZwaTZJSXN5N1pGelB2eTNnOTdrUDRGX3B4SDk2Qk1LY3ZVcERIOHE4VS0tQ1RBYWZWalFPYVc2dDlZZDktdUlYZXNQQWl1QlNiVVJ2TlpmSlM4emtKRWVFRk1oVS1TcjRUYzJWNFZiUF9sMkxRNExBVzlJdldCZHhRRy1JOTRRZG5UazY4a3IwWm44MHZ1dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;FinanceFeeds&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxQMFJBa2ctamlQN29NZWNMaTREaXdLZ3I5X0xHRkk5VWhFQU1HdHY1djhxNUdxQm51ODFvMWdEd0dQV09zYUdZTWVqVXhWSG4wYUoxbjg0RjhZQ2d4LWdsVl9KcDlPNk5kYkFfSmpwcndHaVBpVXRaOWtZMGltVW01YlZmMi1BZExyNXhMbUJyYmZXYzlIRDB1MXgyMWx6VmQ5Z1FNLXQ0MjhRQW9IMTN2UWFMMmg1RjFnNmRTMW1SODd6eG_SAcMBQVVfeXFMUDBSQWtnLWppUDdvTWVjTGk0RGl3S2dyOV9MR0ZJOVVoRUFNR3R2NXY4cTVHcUJudTgxbzFnRHdHUFdPc2FHWU1lalV4VkhuMGFKMW44NEY4WUNneC1nbFZfSnA5TzZOZGJBX0pqcHJ3R2lQaVV0WjlrWTBpbVVtNWJWZjItQWRMcjV4TG1CcmJmV2M